      - "choose-before-act's n/a is a dodge (important) — the rule binds controls sharing one object ('the selector that decides what it acts on'). StatusDot dispatches re-invoke and replaces the whole screen with onboarding; it does not act on the list the four Fields filter, so the rule never engages."
      - "The rulebook write-back is owed now, not at W11 (important) — editing design-rules-index.html inside this WU would move the blob under this run's own pinned receipt, tripping receipt·rulebook-stale and refusing the merge; the flow's e2e asserts exactly that failure mode. DEC-14's slug-immutability guarantees already-written receipts stay valid after later growth, not that mid-epic growth is safe. W5/W7/W9 have also not yet pinned the blob."
      - "CopyText owns the path cell and was overridden silently (important) — the Elements row names CopyText and rejects it on its own @anatomy ('wraps, never truncates'), which a fixed-height row cannot use. Its @use example is not a live call site: FlowDetail renders the URI as a bare <p>, not a CopyText."
